---
mm: 1.4
kind: library
name: c-demo
source: third_party
licence: LICENSE
include-directory: include
c-source: third_party/src/cdemo.c
c-source: glue.c
c-strict: glue.c
c-include: third_party/include
c-include: .
c-option: -DCDEMO_SCALE=3
c-option: -include config.h
folder: ext
folder: test
---

# C sources demo library

A repository-local fixture proving that a library's C sources are compiled
by mm.build on a lane it links itself and linked into a test that reaches its
wrapper: one foreign file, compiled with the lane's ordinary C flags, and one
project-owned glue file, compiled strict. The c-options test both kinds of
option: a definition, and a forced include whose relative path resolves from
this directory, where each C file is compiled.
